      "pinyin": "shàng hé qǐ yǒu de shí hou yì si yí yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "但是分别搭配，意思可能就完全不一样了。",
      "traditional": "但是分別搭配，意思可能就完全不一樣了。",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì fēn bié dā pèi yì si kě néng jiù wán quán bù yí yàng le",
      "english": "“Shang” and “qi” sometimes have the same meaning, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ".. but when you match them up with another character, the resulting meaning can be completely different."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "保罗和小乐还只是朋友的时候，他们一起去小乐的朋友家玩。",
      "traditional": "保羅和小樂還只是朋友的時候，他們一起去小樂的朋友家玩。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hé xiǎo lè hái zhǐ shì péng you de shí hou tā men yì qǐ qù xiǎo lè de péng you jiā wán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "因为玩得太晚了，又喝了很多酒，所以他们决定在朋友家住一个晚上。",
      "traditional": "因為玩得太晚了，又喝了很多酒，所以他們決定在朋友家住一個晚上。",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi wán de tài wǎn le yòu hē le hěn duō jiǔ suǒ yǐ tā men jué dìng zài péng you jiā zhù yí ge wǎn shang",
      "english": "When Paul and Little Le were still just friends, they went to Little Le's friend's house together to play."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "睡觉之前，小乐和保罗说了晚安，准备回到自己的房间，",
      "traditional": "睡覺之前，小樂和保羅說了晚安，準備回到自己的房間，",
      "pinyin": "shuì jiào zhī qián xiǎo lè hé bǎo luó shuō le wǎn ān zhǔn bèi huí dào zì jǐ de fáng jiān",
      "english": "Because they played until late and drank a lot of alcohol, they decided to stay the night at the friend's house."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "突然，保罗叫住了小乐，说：“小乐，我们一起上床吧！”",
      "traditional": "突然，保羅叫住了小樂，說：“小樂，我們一起上床吧！”",
      "pinyin": "tū rán bǎo luó jiào zhù le xiǎo lè shuō xiǎo lè wǒ men yì qǐ shàng chuáng ba",
      "english": "Before they went to bed, Little Le and Paul said goodnight and were about to go back to their respective rooms."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小乐很生气地跑回自己的房间，关了房门。",
      "traditional": "小樂很生氣地跑回自己的房間，關了房門。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè hěn shēng qì de pǎo huí zì jǐ de fáng jiān guān le fáng mén",
      "english": "Suddenly, Paul stopped Little Le and said: “Little Le, let's go to bed together!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le angrily ran back to her room and shut the door."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "保罗觉得很奇怪，",
      "traditional": "保羅覺得很奇怪，",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó jué de hěn qí guài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "他只是想叫小乐明天一起起床离开，为什么小乐会那么生气呢？",
      "traditional": "他只是想叫小樂明天一起起床離開，為什麼小樂會那麼生氣呢？",
      "pinyin": "tā zhǐ shì xiǎng jiào xiǎo lè míng tiān yì qǐ qǐ chuáng lí kāi wèi shén me xiǎo lè huì nà me shēng qì ne",
      "english": "Paul thought it was odd."
    }
  ],
