    "sentence_translations": [
      "“Shang” and “qi”",
      "",
      "“Shang” and “qi” sometimes have the same meaning, ..",
      ".. but when you match them up with another character, the resulting meaning can be completely different.",
      "",
      "When Paul and Little Le were still just friends, they went to Little Le's friend's house together to play.",
      "Because they played until late and drank a lot of alcohol, they decided to stay the night at the friend's house.",
      "Before they went to bed, Little Le and Paul said goodnight and were about to go back to their respective rooms.",
      "Suddenly, Paul stopped Little Le and said: “Little Le, let's go to bed together!”",
      "Little Le angrily ran back to her room and shut the door.",
      "",
      "Paul thought it was odd.",
      "He only wanted to ask Little Le to get out of bed and go home together the next day, why did she get so angry?"
    ]
